@startuml
title 5.6 Consent Trigger — 5th Message
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

actor User
participant "FindCareApp" as UI
participant "PromptDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "ConsentMiddleware" as ConMW
participant "ConsentService" as CS
participant "FindCarePromptFactory" as FCPF
participant "FindCareService" as FCS

== Messages 1-4: Normal flow ==

note over User, FCS: Messages 1-4 flow normally.\nsession_state.message_count increments.\nNo consent trigger.

== Message 5: Consent trigger fires ==

User -> UI: "Show me dermatologists in\nNewport News"
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)
note right: session_state:\n  message_count: 4\n  (will become 5)

Dispatcher -> FCPF: route + execute\n(through middleware chain)

FCPF -> FCS: search_providers(\n  specialty_query="dermatologist",\n  state="VA",\n  city="Newport News")
FCS --> FCPF: {providers: [...], total_count: 12}
FCPF --> ConMW: PromptOutput(providers)

' Post-dispatch: consent middleware fires
ConMW -> ConMW: message_count++\n→ count = 5
ConMW -> ConMW: count % 5 == 0?\n→ YES

ConMW -> ConMW: inject consent trigger\ninto PromptOutput
note right: HIPAA two-tier consent:\nTier 1: Store verbatim transcript\nTier 2: Store de-identified summary\nTier 3: Contact info only

ConMW -> ConMW: set output.consent_required = true
ConMW --> Dispatcher: PromptOutput(\n  providers=[...],\n  consent_required=true,\n  consent_prompt="We'd like to\n  improve our service.\n  May we store a summary\n  of this conversation?")

Dispatcher --> UI: PromptOutput

UI -> UI: render provider cards\n(normal results shown)
UI -> UI: overlay consent dialog
UI -> User: "May we store a summary\nof this conversation?\n[Verbatim] [Summary] [No thanks]"

== User responds to consent ==

User -> UI: clicks [Summary]
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)
note right: consent_response:\n  tier="summary"

Dispatcher -> ConMW: process
ConMW -> CS: summarize_conversation(\n  chat_history=[msgs 1-5])
CS -> CS: Claude Haiku\n→ 2-3 sentence summary
CS --> ConMW: "User searched for bone docs\nin VA, then dermatologists\nin Newport News."

ConMW -> CS: de_identify(chat_history)
CS -> CS: Claude Haiku\nstrips PII per HIPAA Safe Harbor
CS --> ConMW: de-identified history

note over ConMW: Summary and de-identified\nhistory stored via LeadService.\nNormal flow resumes.

@enduml
